⚡️🇷🇺🇺🇦 Recently, Ukrainian drone attacks targeting Crimea have been far more effective at striking targets. Beforehand, only a few drones at the most would make it through; over the past week, there have been numerous impacts in the territory.

This is part of a Ukrainian campaign to de-facto cut off Crimea from the rest of Russia. Gas infrastructure, air defenses, ammunition depots, and most importantly, railways & bridges connecting Crimea to  the north and east have been targeted repeatedly by drones. There are heavy fuel restrictions in the territory.

